ype":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事の髪型と、\n今回の記事の髪型だったらどっちがいい〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この質問の回答めっちゃ聞きたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これについてもコメント宜しくお願いいします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/28/0142475/0019.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-23080":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n こんにちはー！\n \n \n 今日はKEYABINGOの日です٩(^‿^)۶\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH695740DESYG6282D7D4WA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n 今日はひらがなけやきの放送の日です！\n \n \n \n いっぱい#けやBINGOでツイートしてください！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6967YXKA6Q1WJE7DSXDPX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 今回はいっぱい踊っていっぱい汗をかいて頑張っています！！\n \n \n 見所たくさんなので見てください♡\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6978AN5N66FE3VKGACDZ9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 最近はいっぱいテレビ出れて嬉しいなー！\n \n \n \n 毎日毎日恵まれた環境でお仕事させていただけてることに感謝して頑張りたいと思います！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6986F8D5KPKXYCS6E8JP8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 昨日スイーツパラダイスさんから差し入れのケーキをいただきました！！\n \n とーっても美味しかったです♡\n \n \n スイーツだいすきー٩(^‿^)۶\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6996MGTXWW4Y2K5YTJ86Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69A6P2GHRP9JV32Z16FHB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 最近、顔の肉がひどいので痩せなきゃだけど、やっぱりスイーツは我慢できない！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69B4QV7MQV93T3S55WDRX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n 今度みーぱんと美味しいアイス食べに行きたいです！\n \n \n ダイエットしよーって約束したのに、さっそく２人とも今日の朝ごはんにアイスを食べてました（笑）\n \n \n だから青汁のもーって約束しました！\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69C32ZB0WQDA3KV3A8BXY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n みーぱんはスイーツ大好きだけどダイエットしてる仲間です！\n \n 夏は一緒に支えあいながらダイエット頑張りたいです！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69D53EQ017D9JDEAM5D40","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n そしてそして\n 昨日実は、ライブの前に富士急で\n ドドンパと富士山に乗らせてもらいました！\n \n スーーッゴイ楽しかったです！！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69E5HGF1RBT8A7KJH3A62","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n ジェットコースターに乗るのは\n けやかけのロケで高飛車に乗った時ぶりでした！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69F4RXSVAKY39JWSVH66Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69G3VQH1BYYDV48D3WAW1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69H1934Y2BJRA3TNWPADS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69HZFQYWG2SPFR55ZQTRP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n この写真の時ぶりでした！↑\n \n \n この時から時間が経つのはあっという間だな〜〜と思いました。\n \n \n ドドンパは人生初乗りました！\n \n 楽しかったー！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69JZNP2N7A6AA7SY7Y438","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n ゆうかちゃんと隣で乗りました！\n \n 安心感ありました（笑）\n \n \n すごくすごく楽しかったです！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69M05T13P5S8E7SSC9AN0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n そしてそして\n ホテルのお部屋は\n みーぱんとゆうかちゃんとでした！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69N2448QTZ7BVA14BVKDR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n とても居心地よくて落ち着きましたー！\n \n ドラマ見てたくさん笑いました（笑）\n \n 大好きな２人です！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69P2MFMVFVCHMTVRKKYBC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n ライブも空き時間もホテルも\n とっても楽しい夏の思い出ができました！\n \n \n 最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございます。"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-12167":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今迷っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっっっっても、迷っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何で迷っているかというと･･･"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クマのぬいぐるみを、2mか2.6mか3.4m\nのどれにするかで迷っています･･･。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの大きさがいいのかなあ。\n多分2mがベストなのだろうけど、2.6も捨てがたい･･･。でも、2.6にするなら3.4もあり。\nううーん。\nでも、3.4だと玄関でつっかかる可能性大。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えが出ない･･･難問だ･･･\nこれは欅坂に加入してから一番の壁なのかもしれない･･･。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩むーーーーーー。ʕ·͡ˑ·ཻʔ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJBTBTDVPRA9YCRFE43EBZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-33380":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は音楽の日出演しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「裸足でSummer」初披露したよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/07/17/2004547/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爽やかブルー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい好き〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はFNS歌謡祭☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コラボもあるので楽しみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12時間生放送、長いですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂出てきたときはよろしくですっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして同じく明日の19:30〜20:43は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHK総合「こんにちは！動物の赤ちゃん★夏2016」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水族館にロケしてきたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久本雅美さん、片山千恵子アナ、的場浩司さん、酒井美紀さんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和気あいあい 楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際にふれ合いしたり、VTRを見たり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物たちのかわいさやたくましさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飼育員さんの愛情をいっぱい感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/07/17/2004547/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カニちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろにもびっしり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こやつだけ張り付いてたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらもみてね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7/20発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーちゃん表紙のnon-no9月号に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンバーも何人か出させていただいてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は生駒ちゃんとペア♪"},{"ty